  m_text: 'Agents may remember their state as they execute. By collecting execution
    data and behaviour, it enables logging and a greater degree of transparency of
    its actions and decisions.

    

    This can also include longer-term memory
    such as user preferences, recent interactions and outcomes. Some of the data
    collected can be used in reinforcement learning to let the agent learn from previous
    interactions.'
